oints:"Available Points",skill_rank:"Rank",evolve:"EVOLVE",upgrade:"UPGRADE",admin_free:"ADMIN FREE",skill_protocol:"Skill Point Protocol",skill_protocol_1:"* Each card level up grants 1 skill point.",skill_protocol_2:"* Spending skill points permanently enhances your combat capabilities.",skill_protocol_3:"* Higher tier skills require reaching specific card levels first.",unlock_at:"Unlocks at LV.{level}",magic_chance:"Magic Chance",read_all:"Read All",your_turn:"Your Turn",opponent_turn:"Opponent's Turn",select_country:"Please select your country.",ai_strategy:"AI Strategy",strategy_balanced:"Balanced",strategy_aggressive:"Aggressive",strategy_defensive:"Defensive",strategy_random:"Random",strategy_auto:"Auto (Adaptive)",strategy_balanced_desc:"Standard protocol pursuing hardware-software equilibrium. Evaluates max capture points for own side while mitigating recursive capture risk from opponent. It carefully balances offensive pushes with defensive solidifications.",strategy_aggressive_desc:"High-risk protocol focusing on node domination and center control. Prioritizes flipping enemy units even if it leaves internal sectors exposed. Expect highly volatile board states where controlling the center is the main objective.",strategy_defensive_desc:"Security-first protocol. Prioritizes corner occupation and edge reinforcement. Focuses on placing units where they are mathematically impossible to flip, gradually starving the opponent of safe landing zones.",strategy_random_desc:"Entropy protocol. AI selects moves with stochastic variance. Useful for unpredictable training simulations where standard logic does not apply. It completely ignores both safety and potential captures.",strategy_auto_desc:"Real-time adaptive system. Analyzes score delta and remaining moves. Switches to Aggressive when trailing, Defensive when leading, and Balanced in neutral states. This mimics a highly skilled human player.",strategy_balanced_pros:"Consistent performance across all match types. Excellent at minimizing catastrophic losses and capitalizing on opponent mistakes.",strategy_balanced_cons:"Can be outplayed by hyper-specialized strategies. Sometimes lacks the decisive offensive pressure required to break through heavy defenses.",strategy_aggressive_pros:"Dominates the early game and can secure a massive lead through rapid flips. Often overwhelms unprepared opponents quickly.",strategy_aggressive_cons:'Leaves weak values exposed, making it highly vulnerable to devastating "Chain Flip" counters in the endgame.',strategy_defensive_pros:"Extremely difficult to flip. Excels at protecting high-value units and securing points for the endgame. Infuriating to play against.",strategy_defensive_cons:"Provides limited offensive options, making it exceptionally hard to regain control if the board is already lost early on.",strategy_auto_pros:"Maximum tactical flexibility. Responds intelligently to the shifting tides of battle, dynamically adjusting risk tolerance.",strategy_auto_cons:'Hyper-calculated moves can sometimes overlook simple "greedy" opportunities for short-term gain. Can sometimes be tricked into passive play.',strategy_random_pros:"Complete pattern disruption. Impossible for opponents to categorize or predict future moves, causing psychological confusion.",strategy_random_cons:"Zero tactical synergy. Moves may be counter-intuitive or actively self-destructive, leading to unforced errors.",ai_difficulty:"AI Difficulty",difficulty_easy:"Easy",difficulty_medium:"Medium",difficulty_hard:"Hard",difficulty_easy_desc:"Enemy AI logic and card quality are reduced. (Reward 1.0x)",difficulty_medium_desc:"Standard baseline difficulty. (Reward 1.2x)",difficulty_hard_desc:"Enemy AI logic and card quality are greatly increased. (Reward 1.5x)",strategy_impact:"TACTICAL_IMPACT_ANALYSIS",strategy_win_rate_expect:"EXPECTED_WIN_RATE",change_strategy:"CHANGE_TACTIC_PROTOCOL",status_online:"Online",status_ingame:"In-Game",status_offline:"Offline",unique_cards:"Unique Units",total_cards:"Total Collection",opponent_deck_preview:"Opponent Deck",starting_in:"Starting in {seconds}s",edit_card_details:"Edit Card Details",card_custom_name:"Custom Name",card_notes:"Notes (Tactical or Personal)",notes_placeholder:"Enter notes for this card...",name_placeholder:"Enter card name...",fishing_success:"Success! Power +10% during auto-battle.",fishing_fail:"Missed! The fish got away.",fishing_started:"Fishing started! Reel in at the right time.",roulette_title:"Lucky Roulette",roulette_desc:"Special event with high probability of advanced cards.",lucky_roulette:"LUCKY_ROULETTE",item_pack:"Item Pack",buy_item_pack:"Item Pack",item_pack_desc:"Acquire weapons and armor to boost your power.",shop_feature_item_pack_guide_open:"Open item pack guide",shop_feature_item_pack_guide_step_rewards_title:"Item packs reveal 5 gear drops at once",shop_feature_item_pack_guide_step_rewards_body:"One purchase opens five weapon or armor drops immediately. Unlike card packs, this panel is focused on direct gear growth.",shop_feature_item_pack_guide_step_rates_title:"Check the odds quickly, then move on",shop_feature_item_pack_guide_step_rates_body:"Normal, magic, and rare rates are condensed into small badges so the card stays readable and the main buy action stays obvious.",shop_feature_item_pack_guide_step_flow_title:"Use the SNS status panel before buying",shop_feature_item_pack_guide_step_flow_body:"Review the balance panel under the CTA first. If you are short on SNS, jump to Season Hub or Event rewards, then come back here.",shop_feature_ad_removal_guide_open:"Open ad-free guide",shop_feature_ad_removal_guide_step_effect_title:"Ad-Free is a single cleanup purchase",shop_feature_ad_removal_guide_step_effect_body:"It removes visible ads from gameplay screens in one step so battles and browsing feel calmer and less cluttered.",shop_feature_ad_removal_guide_step_purchase_title:"Only one real CTA stays on the card",shop_feature_ad_removal_guide_step_purchase_bo