ki_how_to_play:"How to Play",wiki_how_to_play_1:"SNSHero.com is a tactical 1v1 card battle game. Both players start with an active deck of 5 cards. Players take turns placing cards on a 3x3 grid.",wiki_how_to_play_2:"Each card has four directional stats (Up, Down, Left, Right). When you place a card adjacent to an opponent's card, the facing stats are compared. If your card's stat is strictly greater than the opponent's card's stat, the opponent's card is Captured and flashes to your color.",wiki_how_to_play_3:"The game ends when the board is completely filled (9 rounds). The player controlling the most cards on the board at the end wins the match.",wiki_tips:"Tips & Strategies",wiki_tips_1_title:"Corner Placement:",wiki_tips_1_desc:"A card with two weak stats is best placed in a corner, hiding its weaknesses against the edge of the board.",wiki_tips_2_title:"Baiting:",wiki_tips_2_desc:"Leave a medium-stat card exposed to trick the opponent into capturing it, only to recapture both on your next turn.",wiki_tips_3_title:"Skills & Items:",wiki_tips_3_desc:"Base stats are just the beginning. A common card loaded with defensive items can hold down a flank forever. Upgrade your general Skill Tree to give your whole deck a halo buff.",wiki_search_cards:"SEARCH CARDS...",wiki_print_card_button:"PRINT CARD",wiki_no_cards_match:"No cards match your search.",wiki_search_items:"SEARCH ITEMS...",wiki_no_items_match:"No items match your search.",wiki_overview:"Overview",wiki_filter_all:"All",wiki_card_detail_tab_info:"Info",wiki_card_detail_tab_story:"Story",wiki_card_detail_tab_relations:"Relations",wiki_card_detail_tab_art:"Art",wiki_card_detail_tab_share:"Share",wiki_card_detail_share_template_cta:"Share as Image Template",wiki_card_detail_signature_line:"Signature Line",wiki_card_detail_faction:"Faction",wiki_card_detail_personality:"Personality",wiki_card_detail_role:"Role",wiki_card_detail_element:"Element",wiki_card_detail_recommended_tags:"Recommended Tags",wiki_card_det